full error text/source strings** byte-for-byte. Includes NULL pointers, out-of-range indices, out-of-range codepoints, and stack-overflow depth.\n\n### Phase D — Completion gate\n- [x] SYMBOLS.md: 0 missing/undefined non-libc symbols in Rust.\n- [x] Phase B: every CONFIGS.md row passes across randomized inputs.\n- [x] Phase C: every ERRORS.md row has a passing error-path differential test.\n- [x] Holds under every feature combination (only the single default config exists).\n\nI added `libloading = \"0.8\"` to `[dev-dependencies]` and did not modify anything in `c_src/`. No divergences were found — the Rust translation matched the C ground truth in every test, so no Rust fixes were needed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_read_input_tokens":116900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":402,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e05495f-912c-47bf-afee-7047866965e6","uuid":"6dfdcf15-f058-49f9-9104-cde843bd955e","timestamp":"2026-08-05T06:18:53.470Z"}
